 We will not talk about the Excel solver.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
 Previous encounters with break-even.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
 This was the very first example here.

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
 It was in the first lecture where we were talking about organizing a conference.

8
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000
 There was a fixed cost.

9
